    "P": "setLoopMode pp",
    "O": "setLoopMode off",
    "[": "nudgeStart -1",
    "]": "nudgeStart +1",
    "{": "nudgeStart -100",
    "}": "nudgeStart +100",
    ";": "nudgeEnd -1",
    "'": "nudgeEnd +1",
    ":": "nudgeEnd -100",
    "\"": "nudgeEnd +100",
    ",": "stepSample -1",
    ".": "stepSample +1",
    "Tab": "swapAB",
    "Space": "latchPlay",
    "L": "toggleAuditionMode",
    "Ctrl+S": "save",
    "Ctrl+Shift+S": "saveAs"
  },
  "gaps": [
    "Header right-group x values are resolved from right-alignment at x 1184 with 14 px gaps; measure the prototype if Plex metrics shift them by ±2 px.",
    "Export column y values below the folder block are stacked with 10 px gaps; the metadata box is bottom-anchored (ends y 788).",
    "contract/MANIFEST-FORMAT.md was not in the received bundle — field names follow the derived v1 manifest."
  ]
